---

<div>
  <div class="bm-hero-68__container">
    <div class="bm-hero-68__content">
      <h1 class="bm-hero-68__heading">Long headline to turn your visitors into customers</h1>
      <p class="accent-h accent-h--alt">Accent Heading</p>
